X: 1779290922
T: The Bamburgh Rants
T: The Collpitts, The General Gordon, and Ye Old Elm Tree
C: Martin Matthews
Z: Cameron Cross
R: rant
N: These are named after the 3 pubs which have hosted the Monday session in Durham over 
N: the last 50 years. See recording at https://youtu.be/LkPSt-0y4q0?si=LX8cenzA4__PamoR.
N: I can see this was written by a mandolinist! This is one case where the bowings are
N: crucial for playing some of these runs, and I had to make a few other adjustments.
M: 4/4
Q: 1/2=105
K: Dmaj
