X: 1777755202
T: The Big Sciota
C: Trad.
Z: Cameron Cross
R: reel
N: Named after the Scioto River in Ohio. Also spelled Scioti, Scioty, etc.
N: Neat tune! Simple in its basic form, but it has really grown on me.
N: I'm afraid I don't know if there's a "standard" form of the tune; this is just me 
N: cobbling together what I've heard and what I've invented on top of it.
